#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:9
msgid "OS 执行与生命周期合同"
msgstr "OS execution and lifecycle contract"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:11
msgid ""
"OS 提供有界等待、显式任务和同步存储，设备接口不依赖 scheduler。默认固件是 C11、 静态装配、零平台堆；Native 的 pthread "
"库内部 bookkeeping 不构成 MCU 零堆证据。 产品的任务角色、优先级、栈、队列容量、启动、停止、安全输出和恢复策略由外部工程拥有。 "
"本页描述当前分支已实现的公共接口；最终软件候选、SDK 消费和物理资格仍按各自 实际执行结果验收，不由接口或本文档自动取得。"
msgstr ""
"OS provides bounded waiting, explicit tasks and synchronization storage; "
"device interfaces do not depend on a scheduler. Default firmware uses C11, "
"static assembly and no platform heap. Native pthread bookkeeping does not "
"establish MCU heap-free execution. External projects own product task roles,"
" priorities, stacks, queue capacities, startup, stopping, safe outputs and "
"recovery policy. This page describes common interfaces implemented on the "
"current branch. Final software candidates, SDK consumption and physical "
"qualification each require actual acceptance results; interfaces and this "
"document do not grant them."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:17
msgid "分层与依赖"
msgstr "Layers and dependencies"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:19
msgid ""
"![当前等待与退出：ready-arm-ready-wait-"
"ready，执行者与join责任由外部管理](../../../assets/diagrams/wait-wake-shutdown.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![Current waits/shutdown: ready-arm-ready-wait-ready; external owners manage"
" executors and joins](../../../assets/diagrams/wait-wake-shutdown.svg)"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:19
msgid "当前等待与退出：ready-arm-ready-wait-ready，执行者与join责任由外部管理"
msgstr ""
"Current waits/shutdown: ready-arm-ready-wait-ready; external owners manage "
"executors and joins."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:21
msgid ""
"当前执行语义见[FIG-08及源码依据](../../diagrams.md#fig-08-wait-wake与外部退出)。 "
"后端和完整平台边界见[FIG-01](../../../assets/diagrams/platform-architecture.svg)。"
msgstr ""
"See [FIG-08 and its source references](../../diagrams.md#fig-08-wait-"
"wake与外部退出) for current execution semantics. See "
"[FIG-01](../../../assets/diagrams/platform-architecture.svg) for backend and"
" full-platform boundaries."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:23
msgid "`Core` 保持无 OS/Arch 依赖。发布的 acquire/release 语义独立于内核。"
msgstr ""
"`Core` has no OS/Arch dependencies. Published acquire/release semantics are "
"kernel-independent."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:24
msgid "`Arch` 拥有 CPU-local IRQ 掩码、原子操作和浅睡眠原语，不拥有 Tick、任务或设备。"
msgstr ""
"`Arch` owns CPU-local IRQ masks, atomics and shallow sleep, not ticks, tasks"
" or devices."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:25
msgid "`OS` 以共同接口连接所选后端并检验真实能力；公共 Wait 本身不创建任务、推进设备或派发。"
msgstr ""
"`OS` connects the selected backend through common interfaces and checks "
"actual capabilities. Public Wait itself neither creates tasks, services "
"devices nor dispatches work."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:26
msgid "`SoC` 拥有时钟、控制器、实际 IRQ 和可用计时器；Board 拥有实际引脚、电气与外部器件。"
msgstr ""
"`SoC` owns clocks, controllers, actual IRQs and available timers; Boards own"
" actual pins, electrical facts and external devices."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:27
msgid ""
"`Product` 创建 owner/producer/coordinator，提供 timer/trace/fail-stop port，并启动 "
"scheduler。 `nx_platform_start()` 不替产品启动 scheduler。"
msgstr ""
"Products create owners/producers/coordinators, provide timer/trace/fail-stop"
" ports and start schedulers. `nx_platform_start()` never starts them on the "
"product’s behalf."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:30
msgid ""
"业务通过公共 opaque 任务、通知、queue 和 channel 引用调用共同接口。定义静态存储的 装配文件包含 "
"`nexus/os/storage.h`，目标 include 路径提供所选后端的真实布局；不以 最大 union、固定字节 TCB 池或第二套 "
"sizeof 清单统一二进制大小。每个可执行文件只 链接一个导出共同符号的后端，不增加运行时 OS 判断或分派表。专有能力继续使用明确 扩展。生成的 "
"typed factory 返回既有设备 face，不创建 OS 对象。"
msgstr ""
"Business code calls common interfaces through opaque task, notification, "
"queue and channel references. Assembly files defining static storage include"
" `nexus/os/storage.h`; target include paths supply the actual selected "
"layout. Binary sizes are not unified through a maximum union, fixed-byte TCB"
" pool or second sizeof manifest. Each executable links one backend exporting"
" common symbols, without runtime OS selection or a dispatch table. Backend-"
"specific capabilities remain explicit extensions. The generated typed "
"factory returns existing device faces and creates no OS objects."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:36
msgid ""
"Native entry 可以在 `pthread_create` 返回前执行。入口自己的 join 必须返回 `CONTEXT`，且不能读取外部 "
"owner 尚未发布的 pthread identity 或 started 状态。 其他 start/join 操作仍由唯一外部 lifecycle "
"owner 串行执行；这一修正不提供多 joiner 或跨任务竞争 start 的能力。创建失败不保留 "
"entry/context；资源耗尽与非法参数分别报告。"
msgstr ""
"A Native entry may execute before `pthread_create` returns. Self-join must "
"return `CONTEXT` without reading pthread identity or started state not yet "
"published by the external owner. A unique external lifecycle owner "
"serializes other start/join operations; this does not provide multiple "
"joiners or competing starts across tasks. Native creation failure retains no"
" entry/context references; resource exhaustion and invalid arguments are "
"reported separately."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:41
msgid "等待、时钟与完成"
msgstr "Waiting, clocks and completion"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:43
msgid ""
"`nx_wait_until()` 使用 `ready → arm → ready → wait → ready`。后端必须把序号观察与 "
"进入等待作为不会丢失已锁存 wake 的操作。wake 只是提示；业务 predicate 是结果的 唯一权威，通知序号不转移 payload "
"所有权。单 port 只有一个 waiter，允许后端合同内 多个 publisher；从 arm 到 recheck 之间必须少于 2^32 次 "
"wake。"
msgstr ""
"`nx_wait_until()` uses `ready → arm → ready → wait → ready`. Backends must "
"combine sequence observation and wait entry without losing latched wakeups. "
"Wake is a hint; business predicates alone decide results, and notification "
"sequences transfer no payload ownership. One port has one waiter and may "
"allow multiple publishers under its backend contract. Fewer than 2^32 wakes "
"may occur between arm and recheck."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:48
msgid ""
"任务后端的 deadline 是 `nx_os_now_us()` 时钟域中的绝对单调微秒。Native 使用真实 "
"`CLOCK_MONOTONIC`，不混用外设模型的手动时钟；FreeRTOS／ThreadX 使用 Core "
"`nx_time_now_us()`。裸机使用初始化时提供的时钟。不得在活请求期间 切换时钟域。`NX_DEADLINE_NEVER` "
"真正表示无限等待，不把 UINT64_MAX 转成有限 `timespec`。微秒表达不保证微秒调度精度；阻塞误差还包括 Tick 量化和调度延迟。"
msgstr ""
"Task-backend deadlines are absolute monotonic microseconds in the "
"`nx_os_now_us()` domain. Native uses real `CLOCK_MONOTONIC`, independently "
"of manual peripheral-model clocks; FreeRTOS/ThreadX use Core "
"`nx_time_now_us()`. Baremetal uses the clock supplied at initialization. Do "
"not change clock domains while requests are live. `NX_DEADLINE_NEVER` means "
"actual infinite waiting; UINT64_MAX is not converted to a finite `timespec`."
" Microsecond representation does not guarantee microsecond scheduling "
"precision; blocking error also includes tick quantization and scheduling "
"latency."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:54
msgid ""
"有限 notify deadline 在检查 hint 时仍必须检查过期，持续无关 wake 不能续期。公共 helper 在后端错误后保留一次最终 "
"`ready` 检查：已观察到真实完成可以胜出。 裸机未就绪返回 `BUSY`，调用方继续显式调度。队列立即可用的操作采用 try 语义； "
"只有需要阻塞时才消耗 deadline，失败不改调用方输出。 公共 queue 的 deadline 零表示 try，channel "
"关闭后发送和排空后的接收返回 `CANCELLED`。有限 `nx_sleep_until` 已过期时立即成功，拒绝无限 "
"sentinel；`yield` 只提示调度，不承诺公平、指定下一任务或低优先级进度，两者都不创建 timer worker。"
msgstr ""
"Finite notification waits must check expiry even when inspecting hints; "
"continuous unrelated wakes cannot renew the budget. After a backend error, "
"the public helper retains a final `ready` check so observed actual "
"completion may win. Baremetal returns `BUSY` when not ready, leaving "
"explicit scheduling to its caller. Immediately available queue operations "
"use try semantics; only blocking consumes the deadline, and failure "
"preserves caller output. A zero public queue deadline means try. Closed "
"channel sends, and receives after draining, return `CANCELLED`. An expired "
"finite `nx_sleep_until` succeeds immediately and rejects the infinite "
"sentinel. `yield` is only a scheduling hint: it guarantees neither fairness,"
" a specified next task nor lower-priority progress. Neither creates a timer "
"worker."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:62
msgid ""
"`nx_wait_select()` 的校验和就绪扫描随候选数线性增长。每个 predicate 必须有界， 不阻塞、不执行设备 "
"service；调用者在成功消费后推进自己的 cursor，才能公平轮转。 比较 1、4、16 "
"个候选时应记录扫描次数、任务负载和事件消费规则，不能从一次主机 耗时推导 MCU 最坏延迟。通知合并不累计业务事件，队列或锁存状态才拥有事件数量。"
msgstr ""
"Validation and readiness scanning in `nx_wait_select()` grow linearly with "
"the number of candidates. Every predicate must be bounded, nonblocking and "
"perform no device service. The caller advances its own cursor after "
"successful consumption to obtain fair rotation. Comparisons of 1, 4 and 16 "
"candidates should record scan counts, task load and event-consumption rules;"
" one host duration cannot establish MCU worst-case latency. Coalesced "
"notifications do not count business events; a queue or latched state owns "
"the event count."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:67
msgid ""
"等待不推进 UART/SPI service。共享控制器的生产者不能在 `ready` 内 service；其唯一 execution owner "
"在取消、停止和排空期间仍须运行。timeout/cancel 请求不等于最终 settlement，不释放 request、operation、DMA "
"buffer 或 notification storage。"
msgstr ""
"Waiting never advances UART/SPI service. Shared-controller producers cannot "
"service inside `ready`; the sole execution owner must keep running during "
"cancel/stop/drain. Timeout/cancel requests are not settlement and release no"
" request, operation, DMA buffer or notification storage."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:71
msgid "中断政策与上下文"
msgstr "Interrupt policy and context"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:73
msgid ""
"CPU/SoC facts 包含实际 IRQ 数、实现优先级位数和分组能力。OS runtime policy 明确 区分无内核、PRIMASK 内核和"
" BASEPRI 内核，不能仅凭 ceiling=0 推导内核不存在。 Mainline 调用内核 ISR API 前验证实际 publisher "
"IRQ、priority width、分组和 syscall ceiling；Baseline 按 PRIMASK port 合同检查实际 "
"configurable IRQ。typed IRQ sink 和 priority policy 只约束所选 "
"provider/backend/mode 已实现的通知路径；类型存在或 ceiling 校验通过不建立新模式、新内核或实板 IRQ "
"资格。不支持的组合明确拒绝。"
msgstr ""
"CPU/SoC facts describe actual IRQ counts, priority bits and grouping. "
"Runtime policy distinguishes no kernel, PRIMASK kernels and BASEPRI kernels;"
" ceiling=0 alone does not prove no kernel. Mainline kernel ISR calls "
"validate publisher IRQ, priority width, grouping and syscall ceiling. "
"Baseline validates actual configurable IRQs under PRIMASK-port rules. Typed "
"IRQ sinks and priority policy constrain only notification paths implemented "
"by the selected provider/backend/mode. Existing types or valid ceilings "
"establish no new mode, kernel or physical IRQ qualification; unsupported "
"combinations fail explicitly."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:80
msgid ""
"NMI、HardFault 和内核专属异常不进入这些 kernel wake API。MCU Task API 要求当前 世界 privileged "
"Thread mode，运行时手工掩码已恢复。阻塞、transfer、join 和 sleep 只在合法运行任务且 scheduler "
"未挂起时执行；构造与非阻塞发布按各后端合法的 task/bootstrap 范围执行，不依赖主动挂起内核后的专有可调用性。启动阶段只允许 所选 Port"
" 的规范 bootstrap mask；数值相同不证明掩码所有权。已有上下文检查在 对象变更前拒绝违约调用，但不能代替外部生命周期和完整调用前提。"
msgstr ""
"NMI, HardFault and kernel-specific exceptions do not enter these kernel wake"
" APIs. MCU Task APIs require privileged Thread mode in the current world "
"with manual runtime masks restored. Blocking, transfer, join and sleep run "
"only in an admitted running task with the scheduler unsuspended. "
"Construction and nonblocking publication follow each backend's permitted "
"task/bootstrap scope, without relying on backend-specific calls while "
"deliberately suspending the kernel. Startup admits only the selected port's "
"canonical bootstrap mask; a matching numeric value does not prove mask "
"ownership. Existing context checks reject violations before object mutation "
"but do not replace external lifecycle ownership or complete calling "
"preconditions."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:87
msgid ""
"`nx_notify_wake` 面向 task/bootstrap，`nx_notify_wake_from_isr` 面向受审硬件 IRQ； "
"绑定后的 `port.wake` 保留该后端允许的 task/bootstrap/IRQ 发布域。Native 的 ISR 入口返回 "
"`CONTEXT`，POSIX signal handler 不能借用普通任务合同。"
msgstr ""
"`nx_notify_wake` serves task/bootstrap callers; `nx_notify_wake_from_isr` "
"serves reviewed hardware IRQs. A bound `port.wake` retains its backend's "
"admitted task/bootstrap/IRQ publication domain. The Native ISR entry returns"
" `CONTEXT`; a POSIX signal handler cannot borrow the ordinary task contract."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:91
msgid ""
"只使用 CPU-local mask 不保护 SMP、DMA 对元数据写入或另一个安全世界的 publisher。 IRQ sink 和 context"
" 必须一直存在到实际 provider 停止并证明 publisher quiescent。"
msgstr ""
"CPU-local masking does not protect SMP, DMA metadata writes or publishers in"
" another security world. IRQ sinks/contexts live until providers stop and "
"publisher quiescence is proven."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:94
msgid "静态存储与任务"
msgstr "Static storage and tasks"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:96
msgid ""
"首次使用前将控制对象清零。任务通过选定布局声明对象，提供非空名称、字节栈容量和 context；原生类型只留在装配、后端实现和明确扩展中。创建前按当前 "
"Port 的初始 frame 和对齐要求校验实际栈容量；启动最低容量不能替代任务运行栈预算、异常嵌套 MSP 预算和 FP/MVE context "
"预算。Native 栈须满足 pthread 平台下限并加上应用预算，不能继承成 MCU 成本。"
msgstr ""
"Zero controls before first use. Tasks use selected-layout objects, nonempty "
"names, byte-sized stack capacities and contexts; native types remain in "
"assembly, backend implementation and explicit extensions. Before creation, "
"validate actual stack capacity against the selected port's initial frame and"
" alignment. Startup minimums do not replace runtime task-stack, nested-"
"exception MSP or FP/MVE context budgets. Native stacks must meet pthread "
"platform minimums plus application budgets; they do not establish MCU costs."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:101
msgid ""
"逻辑任务优先级统一为高数值高优先级，由后端映射原生编号；ThreadX 原生优先级 方向相反，不直接传给公共接口。Native 只接受逻辑优先级 "
"0，不忽略不支持的等级或 声称拥有 MCU 抢占保证。内核 tick、时间片与真实响应仍由所选后端和预算决定。"
msgstr ""
"Public logical task priorities increase with their numeric value; backends "
"map native numbering. ThreadX native priorities run in the opposite "
"direction and must not be passed directly to public interfaces. Native "
"accepts only logical priority zero, without ignoring unsupported levels or "
"claiming MCU preemption guarantees. Kernel ticks, time slicing and actual "
"response remain properties of the selected backend and budgets."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:105
msgid ""
"应用通过 `nx_os_run` 显式进入真实 bootstrap，成功不返回；Platform start 仍不启动 scheduler。Native"
" 执行回调后停驻当前引导线程，保留其调用栈，不增加隐藏 coordinator； 进程退出由应用明确决定。不同内核的 bootstrap "
"可调用范围分别维护，不能把运行态 重新解释为冷态或在引导回调中等待未来任务。"
msgstr ""
"Applications explicitly enter the real bootstrap through `nx_os_run`, which "
"never returns successfully; Platform start still does not start a scheduler."
" After the callback, Native parks the existing bootstrap thread to retain "
"its stack, without adding a hidden coordinator. Applications explicitly own "
"process exit. Maintain each kernel's permitted bootstrap scope separately; "
"do not reinterpret running state as cold state or wait for future tasks "
"inside the bootstrap callback."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:110
msgid ""
"MCU 首次 scheduler 启动采用 cold privileged Thread/MSP 合同：`CONTROL.nPRIV=0`、 "
"`SPSEL=0`、`FPCA=0`。启动前不得留下 active FP context 或把 main 切换到 PSP；调用方 "
"不能仅清掉标志来丢弃仍活跃的 FP 状态。MPU bootstrap guard 绑定真实 protected startup 指令、基本 "
"exception frame 与正确 EXC_RETURN，一次性 lease 在 restore 前消耗，重复 raw START SVC "
"不能再次取得启动权限。任务开始后的 FP/MVE 使用由对应 Port 管理， 不是禁用应用浮点能力；实际 context retention "
"仍需要硬件验收。"
msgstr ""
"Initial MCU scheduler startup requires cold privileged Thread/MSP state: "
"`CONTROL.nPRIV=0`, `SPSEL=0` and `FPCA=0`. Do not leave an active FP context"
" or switch main to PSP before startup; clearing flags alone must not discard"
" live FP state. The MPU bootstrap guard binds actual protected startup "
"instructions, a basic exception frame and the correct EXC_RETURN. Its "
"single-use lease is consumed before restore; repeated raw START SVC cannot "
"reacquire startup permission. The selected port manages FP/MVE after tasks "
"begin; this does not prohibit application floating-point use. Actual context"
" retention still requires hardware acceptance."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:117
msgid ""
"可 join 任务返回后的机制由后端决定：FreeRTOS wrapper 发布完成后挂起，等待外部 joiner 删除；Native entry 返回"
" pthread，由真实 try/monotonic clock-join 证明线程 退出；ThreadX wrapper 发布完成提示后返回内核 "
"completion 路径，join 仍检查完成状态并执行删除。 三者均由唯一外部 lifecycle owner 完成 join；成功前不得重用 "
"TCB/栈/context， join 超时保留全部存储。Native 禁止绕过 adapter 执行 `pthread_cancel`、detach "
"或另外一次 join。完成提示本身不能替代后端的实际退出与引用撤离证明。 公共入口为 `nx_task_join_until`。Native "
"有限等待使用可真实链接的 GNU clock-join， 不在完成标志后调用无界 join；仅显式 `NX_DEADLINE_NEVER` "
"允许无限等待。"
msgstr ""
"After a joinable entry returns, each backend uses its actual mechanism: the "
"FreeRTOS wrapper publishes completion and suspends for external deletion; "
"Native returns from the pthread entry and uses actual try/monotonic clock-"
"join to establish thread exit; the ThreadX wrapper publishes its completion "
"hint, follows kernel completion, and still checks completion and deletes "
"during join. One external lifecycle owner performs join. Do not reuse TCB, "
"stack or context before success; timeout retains all storage. Native forbids"
" bypassing the adapter with `pthread_cancel`, detach or another join. A "
"completion hint does not prove actual backend exit or reference withdrawal. "
"The common entry is `nx_task_join_until`. Finite Native waits require "
"genuinely linked GNU clock-join support, never unbounded join after a "
"completion flag. Only explicit `NX_DEADLINE_NEVER` permits infinite waiting."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:126
msgid ""
"永久任务使用独立显式 API，entry 不得返回，control/stack/context 保留到 reset；它 没有 completion "
"semaphore、join 或 destroy。适用于产品确实具有永久生命周期的任务。"
msgstr ""
"Permanent tasks use explicit separate APIs. Entries never return; "
"control/stack/context live until reset. They have no completion semaphore, "
"join or destroy and serve products with genuinely permanent task lifetimes."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:129
msgid ""
"direct task notification 是显式 opt-in：调用方指定已存在的 receiver 和独占 notification "
"index，只有该 receiver 等待。停止并 join publisher 后才能解绑；receiver handle 和 storage "
"一直存在到所有保存的 port 都不再可用。平台不隐式占用应用 notification 槽。"
msgstr ""
"Direct task notification is opt-in: callers identify existing receivers and "
"exclusively owned notification indices; only that receiver waits. Stop/join "
"publishers before unbinding. Receiver handles/storage live until all "
"retained ports become unusable. Platforms reserve no application "
"notification slots implicitly."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:133
msgid "队列与关闭"
msgstr "Queues and closure"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:135
msgid ""
"公共 raw queue 保持最小存储和后端阻塞路径，不包含 close 广播。初始化要求真实 `storage_bytes` 至少容纳 `depth "
"* item_size`，完整声明容量跨度不得回绕或与完整控制 对象重叠；不能仅检查有效 item 区间。绝对 deadline 入口复用同一时钟域，并"
" 避免连续操作把相对等待预算重复放大。较大数据优先排队稳定 slot/handle，而非在 内核临界区复制整个 payload；slot "
"本身仍有明确借用和回收规则。"
msgstr ""
"Public raw queues retain minimal storage and backend blocking paths without "
"close broadcast. Actual `storage_bytes` must hold at least `depth * "
"item_size`; the entire declared capacity span must neither wrap nor overlap "
"the complete control object. Checking only the used item range is "
"insufficient. Absolute-deadline operations reuse one clock domain rather "
"than repeatedly extending relative budgets. Prefer stable slots/handles for "
"large data instead of copying full payloads inside kernel critical regions; "
"slots retain explicit loan and reclamation rules."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:141
msgid ""
"可关闭 channel 使用单独 opt-in 类型和精确最大并发操作数。每个并发操作持有独立 调用方 waiter 存储；close 停止 "
"admission，锁存并唤醒已注册 waiter。关闭后旧 item 可继续 drain，不能继续 send。destroy 需要 "
"closed、drained、users/publishers quiescent。 不得用 periodic polling "
"冒充立即关闭唤醒，也不得让 raw queue 默默承担这项成本。"
msgstr ""
"Closable channels use separate opt-in types and an exact maximum number of "
"concurrent operations. Every simultaneous operation owns independent caller "
"waiter storage. Close stops admission, latches and wakes registered waiters,"
" and permits old items to drain while refusing sends. Destroy requires "
"closed and drained state with users/publishers quiescent. Periodic polling "
"must not masquerade as immediate close notification, and raw queues must not"
" silently bear that cost."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:146
msgid ""
"FreeRTOS closable registry 仅供 task 使用，以 scheduler suspend/resume guard 保护 "
"admission、waiter 注册/退出和 close 广播。内核 give 可能触发 yield，不能假设一个 IRQ critical "
"token 能跨越这个 yield 保持链表不变。maximum_waiters 预算 close 的 调度暂停时间；单 item 复制与 latch "
"give 的 IRQ 屏蔽时间另行测量，不能混为一个成本。 Native 使用同一 mutex 下的条件变量广播和最小 waiter active "
"guard，不复制 RTOS 等待者链；同样检查 waiter 独占与最大并发操作数。raw queue 和 channel 的控制类型分开。"
msgstr ""
"The FreeRTOS closable registry is task-only. A scheduler suspend/resume "
"guard protects admission, waiter registration/withdrawal and close "
"broadcast. Kernel give may yield, so an IRQ-critical token cannot be assumed"
" to preserve the list across that yield. maximum_waiters budgets scheduler "
"suspension during close; IRQ masking for individual item copies and latch "
"gives is measured separately. Native uses condition-variable broadcast under"
" one mutex with a minimal waiter active guard rather than duplicating RTOS "
"waiter lists. It also enforces waiter exclusivity and concurrent-operation "
"capacity. Raw queue and channel control types remain separate."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:153
msgid "配置与成本"
msgstr "Configuration and cost"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:155
msgid ""
"平台 schema-2 和独立 runtime schema-1 TOML 沿既有配置路径选择后端。FreeRTOS 的 可选 `[os]` 由 "
"`tools/configure/kernel.py` 解析为不可变 `KernelProfileIR`；ThreadX 独立政策见[ThreadX "
"配置](threadx.md)。不为普通公共接口再增加配置权威。FreeRTOS 默认 `standard` 延续 1 kHz/八级优先级/Idle "
"128 words/16-byte name；`minimal` 缩短 name 与优先级列表并关闭未用同步能力；`diagnostic` 开 "
"trace；`lowpower` 显式开 custom tickless。生成的实际能力为准，不能用 profile 名推导芯片能力。"
msgstr ""
"Platform schema-2 and independent runtime schema-1 TOML select backends "
"through the existing configuration path. FreeRTOS's optional `[os]` is "
"parsed by `tools/configure/kernel.py` into immutable `KernelProfileIR`; see "
"[ThreadX configuration](threadx.md) for its independent policy. Common "
"interfaces add no configuration authority. FreeRTOS `standard` retains 1 "
"kHz, eight priorities, a 128-word Idle stack and 16-byte names. `minimal` "
"shortens names and the priority list and disables unused synchronization "
"capabilities; `diagnostic` enables trace; `lowpower` explicitly enables "
"custom tickless. Actual generated capabilities govern; a profile name does "
"not imply chip capabilities."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:162
msgid ""
"可覆写字段为 `tick_source`、`tick_hz`、`max_priorities`、`syscall_priority`、 "
"`idle_stack_words`、`max_task_name_len`、`notification_slots`、`mutexes`、 "
"`counting_semaphores`、`task_notifications`、`trace`、`runtime_stats`、`tickless`。"
" 安全 profile 另有 "
"`memory_protection`、`system_call_stack_words`、`security_model`、 "
"`secure_idle_stack_bytes`。默认 MPU 关闭、single-world；MPU 系统调用栈默认 128 words， "
"64–65536 偶数 words。split 的 Secure Idle 默认 128 bytes，64–65536 且 8-byte 对齐； "
"single 不接受作者显式设置此字段。CPU 的 `mpu_regions` 是物理事实，未声明为 unknown， 不能由运行时政策凭空生成 "
"MPU。受维护安全组合见下节，不由参数校验成功推导支持。 SysTick 使用真实 core clock，要求频率整除且 reload 在 24-bit"
" 合法范围；外部 Tick 必须实现强 `nx_freertos_external_tick_setup(uint32_t)`。runtime "
"stats 必须实现 counter start/now；缺失 hook 使链接失败，不提供伪时钟或永远为零的统计。 内核的 "
"mutex／counting semaphore 配置开关不自动建立公共对象 API；实际公共头和 "
"配置能力校验决定通用消费者能使用什么，不能从内核宏推导已维护接口。"
msgstr ""
"Overridable fields are `tick_source`, `tick_hz`, `max_priorities`, "
"`syscall_priority`, `idle_stack_words`, `max_task_name_len`, "
"`notification_slots`, `mutexes`, `counting_semaphores`, "
"`task_notifications`, `trace`, `runtime_stats` and `tickless`. Security "
"profiles additionally use `memory_protection`, `system_call_stack_words`, "
"`security_model` and `secure_idle_stack_bytes`. MPU defaults off and "
"execution is single-world. The MPU syscall stack defaults to 128 words, with"
" even capacities of 64–65536 words. Split Secure Idle defaults to 128 bytes,"
" within 64–65536 with 8-byte alignment; single rejects an authored value. "
"CPU `mpu_regions` is a physical fact, unknown when undeclared, not something"
" runtime policy can invent. Maintained security combinations are listed "
"below; successful parameter validation does not establish support. SysTick "
"uses the actual core clock with exact frequency division and a valid 24-bit "
"reload. External Tick requires a strong "
"`nx_freertos_external_tick_setup(uint32_t)`. Runtime statistics require "
"counter start/now hooks; absent hooks fail linking instead of supplying a "
"fake clock or constant-zero statistics. Kernel mutex/counting-semaphore "
"switches do not automatically establish public object APIs. Actual public "
"headers and capability validation determine what common consumers may use; "
"kernel macros do not prove a maintained interface."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:176
msgid ""
"成本报告分开计算 Wait face、notify、raw/closable queue、每个 waiter、joinable/ permanent "
"TCB、调用方栈、Idle 栈和内核全局对象。保持现有 four-pointer Wait ABI； 共享 ops 表是否值得采用由实际 linked "
"image 和实例数决定。构建时间报告只比较 RAM/Flash/instruction，CPU cycle/latency "
"必须实测，不能从反汇编字节数推导。"
msgstr ""
"Cost reports separate Wait faces, notifications, raw/closable queues, each "
"waiter, joinable/permanent TCBs, caller stacks, Idle stacks and global "
"kernel objects. Preserve the four-pointer Wait ABI; linked images/instance "
"counts decide whether shared ops tables are worthwhile. Build reports "
"compare RAM/Flash/instructions only; CPU cycles/latency need measurements, "
"not disassembly byte counts."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:0
msgid "选择"
msgstr "Choice"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:0
msgid "适用条件与额外责任"
msgstr "Applicable conditions and additional responsibilities"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:0
msgid "普通 notify"
msgstr "Ordinary notify"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:0
msgid "调用方持有独立通知控制；publisher 全部退出后才销毁"
msgstr ""
"Caller owns separate notification control; destroy only after every "
"publisher has exited"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:0
msgid "直接通知"
msgstr "direct notify"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:0
msgid "已存在且唯一的 receiver、独占 index；receiver 生命周期覆盖所有 publisher"
msgstr ""
"An existing unique receiver and exclusive index; the receiver outlives all "
"publishers"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:0
msgid "joinable task"
msgstr "Joinable task"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:0
msgid "entry 可以返回；completion 后仍保留 control/stack，直到外部 join 成功"
msgstr ""
"Entry may return; retain control/stack after completion until external join "
"succeeds"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:0
msgid "永久任务"
msgstr "Permanent tasks"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:0
msgid "entry 永不返回；没有 join/completion 存储，误返回必须 fail-stop"
msgstr ""
"Entry never returns; no join/completion storage; an erroneous return must "
"fail-stop"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:0
msgid "原始队列"
msgstr "raw queue"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:0
msgid "已有独立停止协议；payload copy 成本随 item 大小增长"
msgstr ""
"An independent stop protocol already exists; payload-copy cost grows with "
"item size"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:0
msgid "可关闭队列"
msgstr "closable queue"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:0
msgid "需要关闭 admission 并唤醒 waiter；额外 control 和每操作 waiter 由调用方提供"
msgstr ""
"Close admission and wake waiters; caller supplies extra control and a waiter"
" per operation"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:190
msgid ""
"Native destroy 可能只释放部分 POSIX 资源。首次销毁撤销公开操作准入；每个资源只在 实际销毁成功后解除 "
"ownership。失败后保持同一 control，仅重试 destroy；不得重新 init、进入 wait/send/receive "
"或释放存储。关闭和 join 仍须先完成，不能依靠 destroy 替代 publisher quiescence。内核 queue "
"payload、调度器挂起区与实际 IRQ mask 区的 成本分别计算；scheduler suspended 不等于所有中断均被屏蔽。"
msgstr ""
"Native destroy may release only some POSIX resources. The first destroy "
"revokes admission to public operations; ownership of each resource ends only"
" after that resource is actually destroyed successfully. On failure retain "
"the same control and retry destroy only; do not reinitialize, enter "
"wait/send/receive or release storage. Close and join remain prerequisites; "
"destroy cannot replace publisher quiescence. Account separately for kernel "
"queue payload, scheduler-suspended regions and actual IRQ-masked regions; a "
"suspended scheduler does not mean that all interrupts are masked."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:196
msgid "产品停止顺序"
msgstr "Product shutdown order"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:198
msgid "coordinator 关闭 admission；owner stop 请求所有已接受操作取消。"
msgstr ""
"Coordinator closes admission; owner stop requests cancellation of every "
"accepted operation."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:199
msgid "owner 保持 service/drain；producer/observer 仅观察 acquire `SETTLED`。"
msgstr ""
"Owners continue service/drain; producers/observers only acquire-observe "
"`SETTLED`."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:200
msgid ""
"coordinator join producer；必须已 acquire 观察每个 accepted request 的 `SETTLED`。 再排空"
" slot control 并 detach/join observer；最后一次 callback 返回之前，request、slot "
"和观察者存储均不可复用。业务 payload 还须满足其自身的其他借用合同。"
msgstr ""
"The coordinator joins the producer and must have acquire-observed `SETTLED` "
"for every accepted request. Then drain slot controls and detach/join "
"observers; request, slot and observer storage cannot be reused before the "
"last callback returns. Business payload must also satisfy its own other "
"borrowing contracts."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:203
msgid "coordinator 请求 owner 停止并 join；同时确认 owner idle 包含 publication 已退出。"
msgstr ""
"Coordinator stops/joins owners and verifies that owner idle includes "
"completed publication."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:204
msgid "停止硬件 RX/IRQ publisher 并 detach wake；join 其他可能的发布者。"
msgstr ""
"Stop hardware RX/IRQ publishers and detach wake ports; join any other "
"publishers."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:205
msgid ""
"销毁 notification/queue/guard。仅在全部消费者退出且所选生命周期允许时停止 platform；正在运行的内核继续保留时钟和 "
"Tick。没有通用 scheduler shutdown， 不能从 I/O idle、任务返回或普通停机接口推导内核已经停止。"
msgstr ""
"Destroy notification/queue/guard objects. Stop Platform only after every "
"consumer exits and the selected lifecycle permits it. A running kernel "
"retains clocks and Tick. There is no generic scheduler shutdown; I/O idle, "
"task return or ordinary teardown does not prove the kernel has stopped."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:209
msgid ""
"失败保留 storage，并由产品选择恢复。`QUARANTINED` 是仍有引用的状态，不是允许 释放的终态。一次 destroy 返回 BUSY "
"只是防护，不替代未来 publisher 已停止的证明。 每个成功 milestone 只执行一次；超时继续使用原 absolute deadline "
"的结果，不靠反复 构造新 deadline 掩盖失败。恢复重试由外部策略给出新预算，且继续保留未归还资源。 外部 [UARTOwner "
"示例](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-examples/tree/codex/next-generation-"
"platform/apps/uart_owner_runtime) 实现单 coordinator 的单调停止 "
"milestones；失败后只重试失败阶段，不重复已成功 join。"
msgstr ""
"Failure retains storage, with recovery chosen by the product. `QUARANTINED` "
"retains references and is not a terminal state that permits release. A "
"destroy returning BUSY is only a guard, not proof that future publishers "
"have stopped. Execute each successful milestone once; after a timeout retain"
" the result under the original absolute deadline rather than concealing "
"failure by repeatedly constructing new deadlines. External recovery policy "
"supplies a new retry budget while retaining unreturned resources. The "
"external [UARTOwner example](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-"
"examples/tree/codex/next-generation-platform/apps/uart_owner_runtime) "
"implements monotonic stop milestones under one coordinator; after failure it"
" retries only the failed phase without repeating successful joins."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:216
msgid "低功耗、诊断与安全边界"
msgstr "Low power, diagnostics and security boundaries"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:218
msgid ""
"Arch 的序号复查与浅睡眠保存恢复 incoming PRIMASK；WFI 前 DSB，明确拒绝默认深睡眠。 应用负责唤醒 timer "
"和持续时钟。FreeRTOS tickless 使用 caller-owned timer port：精确 Tick phase、暂停/恢复、绝对 "
"alarm、连续 clock 与异常 overshoot 都有独立合同。未绑定 port 时维持普通 Tick，不猜低功耗设备或 Board 唤醒引脚。"
msgstr ""
"Arch sequence rechecks/shallow sleep save and restore incoming PRIMASK, "
"execute DSB before WFI and reject default deep sleep. Applications own wake "
"timers/continuous clocks. FreeRTOS tickless uses caller-owned timer ports "
"with separate contracts for exact tick phase, pause/resume, absolute alarms,"
" continuous clocks and abnormal overshoot. Unbound ports retain ordinary "
"ticks without guessed low-power devices or wake pins."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:223
msgid ""
"诊断 ring 由调用方提供 capacity；写满不覆盖旧事件，lost counter 饱和。内核 trace 默认 weak no-op，无默认大"
" buffer；产品覆盖 sink 并负责消费。异常 hook 是有界平台 扩展点，安全输出、watchdog/reset、事件持久化和释放策略归产品。"
msgstr ""
"Callers supply diagnostic-ring capacity; full rings preserve old events and "
"saturate lost counters. Kernel trace defaults to weak no-op without large "
"buffers. Products override/consume sinks. Exception hooks are bounded "
"extension ports; products own safe outputs, watchdog/reset, persistence and "
"release policy."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:227
msgid ""
"显式 MPU profile 使用真实 restricted-task kernel port、专用 linker regions 和窄 SVC "
"gateway。调用方在 privileged RAM 提供 TCB/context/syscall stack，在 user RAM 提供 "
"实际任务栈；受保护任务至少 64 words，运行峰值另行预算。只允许普通 RAM 的 RO/RW 且 XN 数据授权，拒绝 "
"MMIO、privileged RAM、越界、重叠或非法 context。默认普通代码、 数据和 provider 均 privileged；只有显式 "
"user text/data 可进入用户区。"
msgstr ""
"Explicit MPU profiles use actual restricted-task ports, dedicated linker "
"regions and narrow SVC gateways. Callers put TCB/context/syscall stacks in "
"privileged RAM and actual task stacks in user RAM. Protected tasks require "
"at least 64 words, with separate runtime peak budgets. Only RO/RW XN data "
"grants in ordinary RAM are allowed; reject MMIO, privileged RAM, bounds "
"violations, overlaps and illegal contexts. Ordinary code/data/providers "
"remain privileged; only explicit user text/data enters user regions."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:233
msgid ""
"默认公开 user 服务为无指针的 delay/tick-read，经真实 MPU veneer/SVC。当前 F4 生产集成不提供 scalar "
"GPIO gateway；公共 copied broker 机制与具体 内核／安全域入口分别维护，不建立任意指针调用或隐式升权。 受维护基础软件组合为 "
"M3、M4 integer/ FP、M23、M33 integer/FP、M55 integer-MVE、M85 float-MVE 及明确 "
"16-region 事实。 Native、M0/M0+、M7 kernel MPU 和 MPU+split 当前 fail closed。基础 "
"Arch/普通 OS 对 这些 CPU 的支持仍独立存在。用户任务不是可 join wrapper，必须永久运行；单 privileged owner "
"在所有外部用户 quiescent 后显式删除另一任务，自删拒绝。没有隐藏 reaper。"
msgstr ""
"Default public user services are pointer-free delay/tick-read operations "
"through actual MPU veneers/SVC. The current F4 production integration "
"provides no scalar GPIO gateway. The public copied broker mechanism and "
"concrete kernel/security-domain entry points are maintained separately, with"
" no arbitrary-pointer calls or implicit privilege elevation. Maintained base"
" software combinations are M3, M4 integer/FP, M23, M33 integer/FP, M55 "
"integer-MVE, M85 float-MVE and explicitly declared 16-region facts. Native, "
"M0/M0+, M7 kernel MPU and MPU+split currently fail closed. Base "
"Arch/ordinary OS support for these CPUs remains independent. User tasks are "
"not joinable wrappers and must run permanently. One privileged owner "
"explicitly deletes another task only after all external users are quiescent;"
" self-deletion is rejected. There is no hidden reaper."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:242
msgid ""
"显式 split 由两个独立 Runtime 图像组成：Secure 侧是明确 Secure CPU facts、baremetal runtime 与"
" `Nexus::SecureContext`；Nonsecure 侧选择匹配 CPU facts 和 split FreeRTOS。 匹配 "
"ISA/FP/MVE/float ABI，Secure link 导出七个真实 SG veneers 与 CMSE import object， NS "
"link 消费该 import 并使用实际 CM23/33/55/85 的 TrustZone-aware non_secure ports， 不能给 "
"NTZ port 设置宏来冒充跨世界 context save/load。"
msgstr ""
"Explicit split builds two independent Runtime images. Secure uses explicit "
"Secure CPU facts, bare-metal runtime and `Nexus::SecureContext`; Nonsecure "
"uses matching facts and split FreeRTOS. Match ISA/FP/MVE/float ABI. Secure "
"links export seven actual SG veneers and a CMSE import object; NS links "
"consume it and actual CM23/33/55/85 TrustZone-aware non_secure ports. Macros"
" on NTZ ports cannot impersonate cross-world save/load."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:248
msgid ""
"每个获准 NS task，包括内核 Idle，均由调用方提供 NS TCB/stack 和独立 Secure metadata/stack。Secure"
" startup 先 prepare，可信 immutable task→context selector 只 "
"返回已准备身份；未知身份拒绝。Secure 栈须 8-byte 对齐，实际 allocation 包括 8-byte seal，64-byte port"
" minimum 不包含 seal，也不代替业务栈预算。split 需要消费者 提供 Idle callback 和匹配 Secure Idle "
"存储；政策只控制 request budget，不提供默认池。"
msgstr ""
"Every admitted NS task, including Idle, has caller-provided NS TCB/stack and"
" separate Secure metadata/stack. Secure startup prepares them first; trusted"
" immutable task→context selectors return prepared identities only and reject"
" unknown tasks. Secure stacks align to 8 bytes; allocations include an "
"8-byte seal. The 64-byte port minimum excludes seals and does not replace "
"business stack budgets. Split consumers provide Idle callbacks/matching "
"Secure Idle storage; policy controls request budgets without default pools."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:254
msgid ""
"租约身份包含可信 task 与单调 epoch；free 保留 metadata/epoch 历史，join 与 observers quiescent"
" 后才能 rebind。已 load 的 context 不能 free。真实 PSP/PSPLIM assembly 处理 save/load，保留 "
"Secure/NS incoming PRIMASK；有界完整性检查发现 seal、stack bounds 或 context 破坏后，保留 "
"lease 并进入不返回的 Secure fail-stop，不释放或隐式恢复。 默认保持双域掩码并持续 "
"spin，没有完成时间界；产品负责明确的安全记录/reset 策略。 NMI/HardFault 不访问这些共享 metadata。NS "
"SVC/PendSV kernel 是受信任边界：普通 NS Thread 不能伪装 Handler 调用，但机制不防御恶意 privileged NS"
" kernel 伪造自身 task 参数。"
msgstr ""
"Leases bind trusted tasks and monotonic epochs. Free retains metadata/epoch "
"history; rebinding requires joins and quiescent observers. Loaded contexts "
"cannot be freed. Actual PSP/PSPLIM assembly saves/loads and restores "
"incoming Secure/NS PRIMASK. Bounded integrity checks detect "
"seal/bounds/context corruption, retain leases and enter nonreturning Secure "
"fail-stop rather than release/recover implicitly. Defaults keep both masks "
"and spin indefinitely without completion bounds; products own explicit safe "
"logging/reset. NMI/HardFault avoid shared metadata. Trusted NS SVC/PendSV "
"kernels form the boundary: ordinary NS Thread cannot impersonate Handler "
"calls, but the mechanism does not defend against a malicious privileged NS "
"kernel forging its own task parameters."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:263
msgid "自动化与实际证据"
msgstr "Automation and actual evidence"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:265
msgid ""
"行为变更先记录真实 GoogleTest/GoogleMock RED，再实现 GREEN，最后重构。mock "
"外部硬件、CPU/内核边界或产品调度动作，不 mock 实现本身。等待竞态以 barrier、 可控时钟和显式调度构造，不能依赖 sleep "
"长短来证明同步。"
msgstr ""
"Behavior changes record real GoogleTest/GoogleMock RED before "
"implementation, then GREEN/refactor. Mock external hardware, CPU/kernel "
"boundaries or product scheduling, not implementations. Wait races use "
"barriers, controlled clocks and explicit schedules rather than sleep "
"duration."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:269
msgid ""
"配置和 evidence 工具使用 Python unittest；hook 和 CI 执行实际发现的完整 suite， 拒绝零测试、过滤、skip-"
"only、陈旧 JUnit 与缺工具。真实 POSIX scheduler 验证 kernel 集成；ARM 编译/link/ELF 报告验证 ABI "
"和资源，不证明 MCU 时序或 context 电气行为。"
msgstr ""
"Configuration/evidence tools use Python unittest. Hooks/CI execute fully "
"discovered suites and reject zero tests, filtering, skip-only runs, stale "
"JUnit and missing tools. Actual POSIX scheduling validates kernel "
"integration; ARM compile/link/ELF proves ABI/resources, not MCU timing or "
"physical context behavior."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:273
msgid ""
"`tools/hil/os_acceptance.py` 提供 OS49–55 的 unbound 计划与严格物理记录验证。验证 重建 "
"admission，绑定实际 ELF/config/CPU ABI/station/workload/instrument，检查完整 register "
"bank、MSP/task peaks、逐样本 deadline、无损低功耗事件和实际安全输出。 工具不运行探针、串口、供电或 "
"Flash；没有设备时所有物理项保持 `not_executed`。"
msgstr ""
"`tools/hil/os_acceptance.py` provides OS49–55 unbound plans and strict "
"physical-record validation. It reconstructs admission, binds actual "
"ELF/config/CPU ABI/station/workload/instruments, then checks full register "
"banks, MSP/task peaks, per-sample deadlines, lossless low-power events and "
"real safe outputs. It does not run probes, serial ports, supplies or Flash; "
"absent equipment leaves every physical item `not_executed`."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:278
msgid "内核升级与新后端接入检查表"
msgstr "Kernel-upgrade and new-backend checklist"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:280
msgid ""
"内核升级先在独立分支锁定 commit/tree 和所有实际使用 Port；不要只升级版本字符串。 审核配置宏、TCB/queue ABI、初始 "
"frame、ISR priority gate、yield/critical 行为和任务返回 wrapper。M7 integer overlay "
"重新确认上游文件 SHA、预期替换次数、incoming PRIMASK 恢复及 errata barrier；原始 vendor "
"文件保持可核对。FP/MVE 保存与 coprocessor 初始化 需要编译宏、真实 ASM/disassembly 和最终硬件 context-"
"switch 记录共同确认。"
msgstr ""
"Pin kernel commit/tree and all used ports in separate branches, not just "
"version strings. Review macros, TCB/queue ABI, initial frames, ISR gates, "
"yield/critical behavior and return wrappers. M7 integer overlays recheck "
"upstream SHA, expected replacement counts, incoming PRIMASK restoration and "
"errata barriers; original vendor files remain auditable. FP/MVE save and "
"coprocessor initialization need matching macros, real assembly/disassembly "
"and eventual hardware switch records."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:286
msgid ""
"升级通过全部 GoogleMock/context tests、真实 POSIX lifecycle、九核链接、profile 正负路径和 formal"
" installed SDK 后，重新记录成本与当前 source identity。旧 clean candidate、旧 ELF "
"和旧物理报告都不能自动授予新内核资格。产品负责批准其实际任务 预算、timing/HIL、恢复策略和发行范围。"
msgstr ""
"After all GoogleMock/context tests, real POSIX lifecycle, nine-core links, "
"profile positive/negative paths and formal installed SDK checks pass, record"
" new costs/current source identity. Old candidates, ELFs and physical "
"reports do not qualify new kernels automatically. Products approve actual "
"task budgets, timing/HIL, recovery and release scope."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:291
msgid "新 RTOS/backend 必须逐项提供："
msgstr "New RTOS/backends must provide:"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:293
msgid "明确 startup/running/suspended/task/IRQ 上下文、scheduler 启动责任和中断政策。"
msgstr ""
"Explicit startup/running/suspended/task/IRQ contexts, scheduler-start "
"responsibility and interrupt policy."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:294
msgid "同域单调时钟、有限及无限 deadline、arm/recheck/wait race 和单 waiter 合同。"
msgstr ""
"One-domain monotonic clocks, finite/infinite deadlines, arm/recheck/wait "
"races and single-waiter contracts."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:295
msgid "每类对象的精确存储、对齐、干净拒绝无新增借用、部分清理失败保留资源及关闭／destroy 条件。"
msgstr ""
"Exact storage, alignment, clean rejection without new loans, retained "
"resources after partial cleanup failure, and close/destroy conditions for "
"each object class."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:296
msgid "returning/permanent 任务生命周期、单 joiner、超时后引用保留和存储复用证明。"
msgstr ""
"Returning/permanent task lifecycles, single joiners, timeout reference "
"retention and storage-reuse proof."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:297
msgid "producer/owner stop 与 request drain 能继续进展，不用强制删除任务解除 borrow。"
msgstr ""
"Producer/owner stop and request-drain progress without forced deletion "
"revoking borrows."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:298
msgid "CPU Port/ABI/context save、实际源依赖、最小资源报告和 missing-hook 链接拒绝。"
msgstr ""
"CPU ports/ABI/context save, actual dependencies, minimum resource reports "
"and missing-hook link failures."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:299
msgid "真实 backend execution 与同一 GoogleTest 合同；新 kernel 不通过只有 mock 的验证。"
msgstr ""
"Real backend execution with the same GoogleTest contracts; mocks alone "
"cannot verify new kernels."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:300
msgid "正确标注 Native/model、ARM link 和 physical station 的不同资格，禁止推测新板接线。"
msgstr ""
"Separate Native/model, ARM link and physical-station qualification without "
"guessed Board wiring."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:302
msgid "错误与恢复责任"
msgstr "Error and recovery responsibilities"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:0
msgid "结果/状态"
msgstr "Result/status"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:0
msgid "调用方责任"
msgstr "Caller responsibility"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:0
msgid "`BUSY`"
msgstr "`BUSY`"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:0
msgid "保持 storage；非阻塞调用方继续显式 service/pump 或按应用政策重试"
msgstr ""
"Retain storage; nonblocking callers continue explicit service/pump or retry "
"under product policy."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:0
msgid "`TIMEOUT`"
msgstr "`TIMEOUT`"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:0
msgid "只结束本次等待预算；不能释放尚未 SETTLED 的 operation/bytes"
msgstr ""
"Only this wait budget ends; unsettled operations/bytes cannot be released."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:0
msgid "`CANCELLED`"
msgstr "`CANCELLED`"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:0
msgid "channel 停止发送准入，已有 item 继续排空；仍需会合用户再销毁"
msgstr ""
"A channel stops send admission while existing items continue draining; join "
"users before destruction."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:0
msgid "`CONTEXT`"
msgstr "`CONTEXT`"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:0
msgid "先恢复合法任务/IRQ/掩码/scheduler 上下文，不在 guard 内重试 kernel"
msgstr ""
"Restore legal task/IRQ/mask/scheduler context first; do not retry kernel "
"calls inside guards."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:0
msgid "`STATE`"
msgstr "`STATE`"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:0
msgid "检查对象生命周期、close、stale ticket、receiver/index 和唯一所有者"
msgstr ""
"Check lifecycle, closure, stale tickets, receiver/index and sole ownership."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:0
msgid "`QUARANTINED`"
msgstr "`QUARANTINED`"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:0
msgid "保留全部 borrow，owner 继续 recovery/drain，产品决定安全输出/reset"
msgstr ""
"Retain all borrows; owners continue recovery/drain while products choose "
"safe outputs/reset."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:0
msgid "`UNSUPPORTED`"
msgstr "`UNSUPPORTED`"

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:0
msgid "在配置/接入阶段选择真实能力；不静默启用替代 worker 或改变模式"
msgstr ""
"Select actual capabilities during configuration/integration; no silent "
"substitute workers or modes."

#: ../../../../docs/reference/contracts/os/execution.md:314
msgid ""
"平台不把这些结果自动映射成 retry、重启、写 Flash 或恢复安全输出。生产策略必须 "
"使用产品自己的预算、告警和状态机，并保留实际失败路径的原始证据。"
msgstr ""
"The platform does not map statuses automatically to retries, restarts, Flash"
" writes or safe-output restoration. Production policy uses product budgets, "
"alarms/state machines and preserves raw failure evidence."
